        ('S03', 'P1', 'Insurance comparison (owner, landlord, mixed-use)', 'Matched-coverage quotes for all three forms; check FAIR Plan/DIC and earthquake exclusions.', 'Could move the live/rent margins; estimates are not quotes.', 'insurance cdi2026'),
